    "description": {
      "value": "<h3>Features</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Sap)</strong></p><p>If you hit a creature with this weapon, that creature has Disadvantage on its next attack roll before the start of your next turn.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Counter-Thrust</strong></p><p><strong>Reaction.</strong></p><p>As a Reaction when a creature you can see hits you or an ally within your reach with an attack, you can raise your shield to intervene. Roll [[/r 1d8]] and add it to the target's AC against that attack, potentially causing it to miss. If this causes a melee attack to miss, you can immediately make one Lance attack against the attacker as part of the same Reaction.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Guard Dash</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p><p>The lance is heavy, but you use your shield's momentum to push forward. As a Bonus Action, you can move up to 15 feet in any direction without provoking Opportunity Attacks, keeping your guard raised as you reposition.</p></div>",
      "chat": "<div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Sap)</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Counter-Thrust</strong></p><p><strong>Reaction.</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Guard Dash</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p></div>"
    },
